    "logicTab": {
      "title": "Active Consciousness Logic",
      "step1": "1. Heartbeat Trigger",
      "step1Desc": "APScheduler triggers periodically, default interval 300s (5 min). Checks if active consciousness is enabled and within active time window.",
      "step2": "2. Context Collection + Hindsight Recall",
      "step2Desc": "ContextCollector fetches recent N messages across sessions (default 200, filters Tool messages), and calls Hindsight Recall to retrieve relevant memories. Collected info includes: conversation history, emotion state, time awareness, weather, user habits.",
      "step3": "3. Emotion Evolution + LLM Evaluation",
      "step3Desc": "VA model natural evolution (Arousal decay, Social Need growth, Valence regresses to neutral), then LLM evaluates current emotion based on context. Dynamically merges evolved and LLM values by confidence (high trust: 30% evolved + 70% LLM, low trust: 70% evolved + 30% LLM).",
      "step4": "4. Decision Matrix Scoring",
      "step4Desc": "score = intensity × time_fitness × silence_factor × frequency_limit. Combines emotional intensity (social_need×0.5 + arousal×0.3 + valence×0.2), time fitness, silence duration, and frequency limit. Decision based on score vs thresholds: auto_send (≥send_threshold), memory (≥memory_threshold), skip (<memory_threshold). Skip does not call LLM, saving tokens. send_threshold and memory_threshold can be set to the same value.",
      "step5": "5. Thought Generation (LLM)",
      "step5Desc": "Only skip bypasses LLM. Both memory and auto_send call LLM to generate thoughts. ThoughtEngine uses system/user message separation: system contains persona+conversation+memory+environment, user contains task instruction (with output priming). LLM can output SKIP to indicate no desire to contact user. max_tokens=0 means no output length limit.",
      "step6": "6. Send Protection Check + Execute Action",
      "step6Desc": "Protection check only blocks actual sending of auto_send: 5-min wait after user message, chat heat > 3.0, emotional intensity < 0.15, 30-min cooldown, max 2/hr and 5/day. skip → skip. memory → store as memory. auto_send not blocked → send. auto_send blocked → don't send, store thought to Hindsight. All non-skip paths write to thought log.",
      "step7": "7. Longing Score Calculation",
      "step7Desc": "longing_score = min(silent_min/gap_minutes, 1.0) × decay_factor. Each user reply reduces by 10%, minimum 10%. Levels: calm → longing → missing → yearning → anxious.",
      "step8": "8. Emotion State Persistence",
      "step8Desc": "Saves updated emotion state (VA values + dominant emotion + update time), writes to heartbeat log (including decision details, duration, LLM call records), for frontend display and next heartbeat evolution.",
      "terminology": "📖 Terminology",
      "terminologyContent": "<p><strong>VA Model</strong> (3 emotion dimensions):</p><ul><li><strong>Valence</strong>: Positive/negative emotion, 0=negative, 1=positive, 0.5=neutral</li><li><strong>Arousal</strong>: Activation level, 0=calm, 1=excited</li><li><strong>Social Need</strong>: Desire to socialize/chat, 0=none, 1=very high</li></ul><p><strong>Core Metrics</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Longing Score</strong> (longing_score): Based on silence duration and reply frequency, 0-1</li><li><strong>Chat Heat</strong> (chat_heat): User messages in last hour</li><li><strong>Emotional Intensity</strong> (intensity): social_need×0.5 + arousal×0.3 + valence×0.2</li><li><strong>Decision Score</strong> (score): intensity × time_fitness × silence_factor × frequency_limit</li></ul>",
      "decisionDetail": "📊 Decision Threshold Details",
      "decisionDetailContent": "<p><strong>intensity</strong>: social_need × 0.5 + arousal × 0.3 + valence × 0.2, minimum 0.2</p><p><strong>time_fitness</strong>:</p><ul><li>7:00-9:00 morning: 1.0 | 9:00-12:00 work: 0.8 | 12:00-14:00 lunch: 0.9</li><li>14:00-18:00 work: 0.7 | 18:00-22:00 evening: 1.0 | 22:00-23:30 bedtime: 0.8 | 23:30-7:00 late night: 0.3</li></ul><p><strong>silence_factor</strong>:</p><ul><li>&lt;30min: 0.6 | 30-60min: 0.75 | 1-3hr: 0.85 | 3-6hr: 0.95 | &gt;6hr: 1.0</li></ul><p><strong>frequency_limit</strong>: Not exceeded 1.0, exceeded 0.0</p><p><strong>Decision Thresholds</strong>: ≥send_threshold auto_send | ≥memory_threshold memory | &lt;memory_threshold skip</p>",
      "protectionRules": "🛡️ Protection Rules",
      "protectionRulesContent": "<ul><li><strong>Wait after user message</strong>: No send within 5 minutes of user message</li><li><strong>Chat Heat</strong>: No send when heat > 3.0</li><li><strong>Emotional Intensity</strong>: No send when intensity < 0.15</li><li><strong>Cooldown</strong>: No send within 30 minutes of last send</li><li><strong>Frequency Limit</strong>: Max 2/hour, max 5/day</li></ul>",
      "heatLevelsInfo": "📈 Chat Heat Levels",
      "heatLevelsContent": "<p><strong>Formula</strong>: chat_heat = user messages in last hour / 1 hour</p><ul><li>0.0-0.5: cold</li><li>0.5-1.0: warm</li><li>1.0-3.0: hot</li><li>> 3.0: fire</li></ul>"
    },
